            "Identify the main forms of repeated harmful comments, including insults, humiliation, belittling, ridicule, and persistent criticism."
        )
        self.sub_tasks.append(
            "Describe the possible emotional, cognitive, and behavioral effects on a person who receives these comments over time."
        )
        self.sub_tasks.append(
            "Explain why frequency, relationship closeness, social setting, and personal history can shape the intensity of these effects."
        )
        self.sub_tasks.append(
            "Review historical and social contexts where repeated demeaning language has been used to control, isolate, or lower the status of individuals or groups."
        )
        self.sub_tasks.append(
